<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR drops to 12.10pct from  12.12pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR drops to 12.10pct from  12.12pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month dropped to 12.10 percent from 12.12 percent and the bid rate (Athibid) eased to 11.61 percent from 11.62 percent.</p>
